\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 67v-68r}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Notizen: Behandlungsanweisungen und Rezepte (bes. zu Gicht und Augenleiden}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 ) (Nachtrag)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (blockweise nachgetragen, ohne Einrichtung und Beachtung eines Schriftraums, 67v einspaltig, 68r zweispaltig
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Vt cognoscas cuius sit, quod coeuntes non generant: fac ut uir mingat in uno uase fictili. Et stet illud uas in frigido loco et posito ordeo in urina illa stet per vii dies. Et si germinauerit scias, quod bene potest generare ... Eodem modo mingat mulier in alio uase sic preparato ... si uero germinauerit potest concipere\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicamen ad plagas sanandas et carnes cito uirigendas et consolidandas ... nec emplastrum inde moueatur seruari potest per duos annos. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Puluis ille optimus contra omnem guttam. Recipe hermodactilorum dragmam 12 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et scrupulum. Turbit. Diagridii a natura dragmas 8. Gariofilorum, zinziberis, nucismus folii a natura dragmas 4 ... cum uino calido. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Antidotarium contra gutam et podagram calidam probatissimum. Recipe hermodactilorum, manne, uiolarum omnium trium dragmas x ... tepida. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Anti\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [dotarium]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  expertum contra frigidam podagram et omnes pedum dolores. Recipe hermodactilorum, diagridii amborum dragmam ... cum condito in balneo. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (67v) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Oleum frumenti sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Opium sic fit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Licium sic fac\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... . (67v) [querst\u228 \'e4ndig am \u228 \'e4u\u223 \'dferen Rand der Seite, bezogen auf das Rezept \u8218 \'82Pulvis ille optimus contra omnem guttam\lquote :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Puluis ille optimus. Recipe hermodactilorum dragmas 12 et scrupulum  turbit. Diagridii a natura dragmas viii. Mirre, zinziberis ... qui guttam habet.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (68ra) Rubriken z. B.: [am Zeilenbeginn Rasur]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Realgar est uena terre, que de Alexandria aportatur ... et ficum et lupam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad cataractam oculi tollendam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicamen ad eos, qui non uident\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad tumorem et calorem et sanguinem oculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sanguinem oculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicina ad tumorem oculorum et dolorem et calorem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad pannum oculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad sanguinem oculorum remouendum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... (68rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad ungulas oculorum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad clarificandum uisum ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad lacrimas stringendas ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad splenem ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Calcecumenon sic fit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Cerusam sic fac ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Eruginem campane sic fac ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Calcidum sic fac ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Afronitrum sic fac ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Alphita sic fit ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Vnguentum Constantini super omnia vnguenta de mundo dum sanguis in oculis habundat et in qualibet superfluitate sanguinis ... dolorem mitigat, clarificat, attrahit et expellit\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Ad caliginem oculorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...  }

