\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 102ra-121vb}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (= Schum 100ra-119vb) \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Areolae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 \lquote  (= \u8218 \'82Revocativum memoriae\lquote , Teil III)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 102ra Prolog [\u220 \'dcberschrift]: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Aureole Johannis de Sancto Amando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. [Textbeginn Prolog:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 S\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 icut dicit Galenus primo Simplicis medicine}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  capitulo viii in fine, non est possibile, ut homo accipiat medicinam compositam accepcione bona\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et repressiuis earum determinabimus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 102ra-121va Text: [Kapitelrubrik:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De medicina abstersiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. [Textbeginn:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >M<edicina abstersiua habet proprietatem mouendi humores viscosos grossos}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (121va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Aut si alicui membro noceat, appones aliquam medicinam illud membrum respicientem et ipsum confortantem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Expliciunt Areole Johannis de Sancto Amando\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 121va-d Kapitelverzeichnis: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicina abstersiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicina adustiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicina aperitiua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Viola\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Vrtice semen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Yreos\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre 855.6}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Kapitelverzeichnis), 1308.6, 1484.1-3 (neun Hss., darunter {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CA 2\u176 \'b0 77b}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[2].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 245}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[3].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 271}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , jedoch ohne diese). \endash  Schalick, Jean de Saint-Amand (1997), S. 295 f. (zum Text), S. 470-473 (40 Hss., darunter diese; weitere zehn Hss., auch nur der \u8218 \'82Areolae\lquote , ebd., S. 467 f. als \u8218 \'82Revocativum moemoriae\lquote  verzeichnet). \endash  Ed.: Pagel, Areolae des Johannes de Sancto Amando (1893), S. 1-122 (aus vier Hss., darunter diese und CA 2\u176 \'b0 245; ebd. S. XVII Verzeichnis von ca. 20 Hss.). }

