\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (305va) [\u220 \'dcberschrift:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 <Incipit tractatus de gradibus ordinatus a magistro Bernardo de Gordonio decano medicorum in Montepessulano anno domini m\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ccc\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  cum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 iii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 o\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Text:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 D\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 octrinam de gradibus intendimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  triplicem ordinare\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (310rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sunt igitur plures sapores, sed non bene sensu distinguibiles. pre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 etc. Expletus est tractatus breuis et vtilis de gr\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [a]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 dibus, compilatus a magistro Bernardo de Gordonio decano in almo studio Montispessulan\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [ensi].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Thorndike/Kibre 460.10 }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (ohne diese Hs.). \endash  Edition: Pagel, Graden der Arzneien (1895). \endash  Hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Demaitre, Doctor Bernard de Gordon (1980), S. 180 f. (mit dieser Hs.). \endash  Zum Text:  Sudhoff, Bernhard von Gordon (1917), S. 179-180; Demaitre, ebd., S. 48-51.
