\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1ra-1rb Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >Liber Canonis primus, quem princeps Aboali Abinsceni de medicina edidit, translatus a magist\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [r]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 o Girardo Cremonensi in Toleto. Verba Aboli Abinsceni.< {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >I<n primis Deo gratias agemus sicut sui ordinis celsitudo}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >L<iber quintus de componendis medicinis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Et ipse est antidotarium. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1rb-2va Kapitelverzeichnis Buch 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Libri primi sunt quatuor funum<. Fen prima est de diffinicione medicine et subiectis eius et rebus naturalibus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >C<apitulum tricesimum primum: A quibus medicationibus est nobis incipiendum. >Omnia igitur capitula huius primi libri sunt ducenta et sexaginta tria.<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 2va-55va Text: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Capitulum primum doctrine prime fen prime libri primi de diffinitione medicine.< >{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 D<ico, quod medicina est scientia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , qua humani corporis dispositiones noscuntur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... ut ipsum spasmosus remoueat motus, ne humorem resoluat naturalem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Explicit:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sit quantitas hec nostri sermonis compendiosi de principiis uniuersalibus doctrine medicinalis sufficiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  ... nos iuuabit, cui sint >grates secundum ipsius in numerabiles misericordias< Deo gracias. Amen.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Rest von 55va und 55vb leer.}

