\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\u220 \'dcberschrift:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt experimenta Rasis de doloribus iuncturarum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. [Text:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >D<ixit Rasis: Volo in hoc capitulo dicere medicinas, que neccessarie sunt doloribus iuncturarum}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  ...  (354vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 pinguedinis aquile unciam i, pinguedinis uituli uncias iii confice et utere. 
