\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1ra-b Prolog:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  >Incipit liber canonis primus, quem princeps Abhoali ab \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Auicenni de medicina edidit, Verba Abhoali Auicenne<. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >I<n primis deo gratias agemus }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sicut sui ordinis celsitudo ... \endash  ... {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >L<iber v}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28\chcbpat17 us}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17  est de componendis medicinis }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et ipse est antidotarium. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 1rb-2vb Kapitelverzeichnis Buch 1: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >L<ibri primi sunt iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs28 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  fen i distinctiones. >F<en prima est de diffinicione medicine et subiectis eius et rebus naturalibus ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >C<apitulum xxxi. A quibus medicacionibus est nobis incipiendum. >O<mnia igitur capitula huius primi libri sunt ducenta et sexaginta tria.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 2vb-83vb Text: [\u220 \'dcberschrift Kapitel 1:]>\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Capitulum primum doctrine prime libri primi de diffinicione medicine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Textbeginn:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >D<ico, quod medicina est scientia}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , qua humani corporis dispositiones noscuntur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ... \endash  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (83vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ut ipsum spasmosus remoueat motus, ne humorem resoluat naturalem.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Sit quantitas hec nostri sermonis compendiosi de principiis uniuersalibus doctrine medicinalis sufficiens\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... nos iuuabit, cui sint grates secundum ipsius innumerabiles misericordias. Amen. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Darunter:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit primus liber Auicenne\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <.}

