\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (84ra) [\u220 \'dcberschrift:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit liber, qui principiis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Abhaliali Auicenni de simpliciibus medicinis<. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Textbeginn:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >H<orum librorum, quos de medicina specificauimus}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , primus est de iudiciis universalibus in medicina. Et secundus est eorum, hic liber agregatus de medicinis singularibus ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (157rb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [endet mit \lquote De zuccaro alhausar\rquote , Areola \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 membra expulsionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 confert renibus et vesice. Explicit liber secundus. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit liber secundus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <.
