\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 351ra-454ra}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (= Schum 347ra-450ra) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Buch 4}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 351ra-353vb Kapitelverzeichnis Buch 4: >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Tractatus secundus de febribus putrefactionis. Sermo vniuersalis de febribus putrefactionis<. >L<iber canonis quartus incipit de egritudinibus particularibus, que cum accidunt non appropriantur membro, continens vii fen, que comprehendunt xxiii tractatus et summas duas. >F<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 en\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  prima de febribus et est iiii\plain \f1\i\super\lang1033\fs24 or\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tractatus. >F<ractatus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  primus de febre effimera \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (353vb)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >D<e attricione unguium. >M<ors sanguinis sub ungue. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Finis capitulorum quarti libri\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 353vb-454rb Text:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\u220 \'dcberschrift\~:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Fen prima de febribus et est quartus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tractatus. Tractus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  primus de febre \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [effimera]<\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (354ra) [Textbeginn:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >F<ebris est calor extraneus accensus in corde }}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (454rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et pone super ipsam post et in fine eius emplastrum basilicon. >Expletus est liber quartus \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Rasur] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 canonis pricipis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Albahali Hasen filii Alibeseni.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <}

