\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 47ra-49rb}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Averroes}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De tyriaca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 \lquote  in der \u220 \'dcbersetzung des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Armengaudus Blasii}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (Nachtrag von NH2)
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [I]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 nquit magnus medicus Hameth Auerroys: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Postquam deo gracias egero}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , dicam, quod quidam ex amicis meis, cuius honorem teneor, me rogauit, ut eius dictis satisfacerem via experimenti et rationis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (49rb) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Et nunc autem quiescat postulatio}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  tua et sufficiat satisfactio secundum tempus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit Tyriaca Aueroys.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 eTK 0750B (sechs Hss., ohne diese, aber mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 249}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[1].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 270}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \endash  Druck in: Magninus Mediolanensis, Regimen sanitatis, Lyon um 1502 (GW M19896; Klebs 640.5), Bl. 98v-104v (zus\u228 \'e4tzlich mit dem Schlussatz: \u8222 \'84Laus sit eterno qui mihi complendi posse largitus est\ldblquote ).}

