\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 57r-58ri }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Parma}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Practicella de medicinis simplicibus ex dictis Mesue\lquote }}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Prolog:] {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quoniam quidam de melioribus amicis, quos habere videor, me rogauerunt}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , ut in scriptis redigerem medicinas digestiuas et euacuatiuas simplices et componit \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!; sonst: compositas), \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quibus medici vtuntur communiter ... et de hiis omnibus quam breuiter potero actorum medicine auctoritatibus inherens. Incipiam a digestiuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . [Rubrik rechts nachgetragen von NH2:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Medicine simplices digerentes coleram\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. [Text:] (57ra) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >M<edicine digestiue colere sunt hee simplices: scilicet viola}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Rosa \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Endiuia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Lactuca \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Semperuiua \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 /\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Portulaca \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 / \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Semina melonis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (58ri) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 composite sunt eedem cum medicinis infrigidantibus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 renes, que dicte sunt\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Darunter nachgetragen von NH2:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit Practica magistri Johannis de Parma, alii dicunt liber Arnaldi de Villa Noua, de medicinis digestiuis, euacuativis et confortativis et earum dosibus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 eTK 0861B und 0862A (Text, Varianten, 11 Hss.), 1244H und 1295J (Prolog, Varianten, 14 Hss.). \endash  Abdruck aus der Hs. UB Leipzig, Ms 1209: Mehner, Johannes von Parma und seine Practicella (1918), S. 14-21. \endash  Hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung: Mehner, ebd., S. 5-13 (19 Hss. aus Leipzig, M\u252 \'fcnchen, Breslau sowie CA 2\u176 \'b0 77b, 174, 236, 237, 267, 271, 303, 400). }

