\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Q]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ve est utilitas respiracionis, quam quidem non quecumque\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 manifestum est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (111vb) [bricht ab in Cap. 4 \u167 \'a7 \ldblquote De senibus\rdblquote :] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 atestetur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  autem frigidati et respiracionis species minor simul \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [et rarior fiens.]
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 eTK 1183I. \endash  https://www.galenolatino.com/traduzioni.php?id=68 (acht Hss., darunter diese). \endash  Druck in: Galenus, Opera, Venedig 1490 (GW 10481; Klebs 432.1). \endash  Edition des griechischen Textes und \u220 \'dcbersetzung ins Englische: Furley/Wilkie, Galen on respiration and the arteries (1984), S. 71-133.}

