\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 IIv}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Notizen diagnostisch-therapeutischen Inhalts}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Nachtr\u228 \'e4ge, j\u252 \'fcngere gotische Kursive, 1. Viertel 15. Jh., vielleicht von der Hand des Amplonius), vier Abschnitte: (1) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota quomodo tyriaca cognoscitur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  siue probatur \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Darunter radiert, mit Multispektralfotografie lesbar:] (2) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Recipe liquirice et comede quando}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; [mit etwas Abstand darunter:] (3) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nota vnam cautelam}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , quando medicus non potest habere per certa signa, vtrum patiens sit constipatus uel laxatus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et istud est multum necessarium scire a medico\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (4) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Item non est inconveniens}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , quod medicus querat a paciente de suo appetitu et habito appetitu \u8230 \'85 et inquirere per cautelas illa, que non potest habere per signa certa.}

