\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 1v-4r}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Sprichw\u246 \'f6rter, meist lat., auch dt.}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  in den leeren Zeilenresten mit Rot eingetragen (Nachtrag in \u228 \'e4lterer gotischer Kursive, 3. Viertel 14. Jh., Deutschland), u.a. (1v): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Qui dare vvlt aliis, non debet dic}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 [ere]}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vvltie\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (recte: vultis) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Nr. 24012}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Pax audientibus librum}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (2r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[2].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Cum bonis ambula}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Amor vincit omnia \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (ebd. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Nr. 998}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (2v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[3].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Magistrum metue}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Troco lude, aliam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [= aleam?] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 fuge\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 G\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [ab]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 riel\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (?). \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Foro te para\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Propria laus sordet. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[2].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, ebd. Nr. 22652}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). (3r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[4].5666d/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Got behut dich mentsche}}\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Non est in mundo diues, qui dicat: Habundo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[3].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Proverbia, Nr. 17645}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[5].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Disce puer dum tempus habes}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , ne tempora perdes\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[4].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther, Nr. 5876}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). (3v) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[6].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Letetur}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . (4r) {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[7].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Dum satur est venter}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , letum capud est mihi semper \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (\u228 \'e4hnlich {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[5].8330/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Walther Nr. 6704}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 . Amor vincit omnia\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 
