\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (9ra-vb) [Prolog:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipit prologus Afforismorum Ypocratis. >A<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 phorismorum Ypocratis huius noue edicionis ea causa extitit}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , quoniam antique nullum earum que uiciosis translationibus inesse assolent culpe genus defuit ... - ... quid diccione diues intellectibilis.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (9vb-19ra) [Text:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Hic incipit liber Amphorismorum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <. \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >U<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ita breuis, ars uero prolixa, tempus autem acutum, experimentum uero fal}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 lax \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 \u8230 \'85 - \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ... repente\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 innascitur ac de gutture\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 non possit mortale\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Binnengliederung: (9vb-10va) Particula I, (10va-11vb) Particula II, (11vb-13ra) Particula III, (13ra-14vb) Particula IV, (14vb-16vb) Particula V, (16vb-17vb) Particula VI, (17vb-19ra) Particula VII. eTK {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8334/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 0113F}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Prolog, diese Hs.), {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8334/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 1704G}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Text, diese Variante); Kibre, Hippocrates Latinus, 1985, III.A, S. 41 (diese Hs.).
