\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 1. {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930gi/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 De signa humorum}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Exzerpt): [Q]{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 uoniam de melioribus amicis quos habere videor rogant}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ut in scriptis redigerem breuiter signa uniuscuisque humorum in corpore hominis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Et mihi placet, ut in primis loquar de signis uniuscuius humorum \u8230 \'85 secundo de digestiuis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 uniuscuius humorum tam simplicibus quam compositis, tercio de dosi medicinarum \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  - ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 in membris predictis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . [bricht nach Prolog ab].
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 Laut eTK {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[0].8334/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 1270E}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  und {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezlit[1].8334/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 1295J}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  mehrere Werke mit diesem Incipit: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Antonius de Parma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[3].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Compendium medicinae\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernardus de Gordonio}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[4].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Compendium compositionum\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[2].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Bernardus de Villanova}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[5].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Practica\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[3].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Johannes de Parma}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 : {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[6].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 \u8218 \'82Practicella sive De medicinis simplicibus ex dictis Mesue\rquote }}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . Nur bei den einleitenden Formulierungen teilweise \u252 \'fcbereinstimmend mit dem Text des Johannes de Parma, \u252 \'fcberpr\u252 \'fcft an {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CA 2\u176 \'b0 400, 126ra-128rb}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , vgl. https://resolver.staatsbibliothek-ber