\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (7rb-vb) [Prolog:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >Q<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 voniam de urinarum differentia negotium multi ueterum medicorum aggressi sunt scribere}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  ... - \u8230 \'85 hic incipe doctrina secundum genera et secundum species et differencias earum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (7vb-13rb) [Text:] [\u220 \'dcberschrift am Rand nachgetragen: \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Diffinicio urine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 >U<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 urina }}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 (!)}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 est ergo colamentum sanguinis, hanc autem alii superfluitatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  (13rb) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 et species et differencias conuenienter exposuimus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Explicit liber Teophili urinarum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  
