\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >Incipit liber de iudicationibus urinarum a uoce Theophili<\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6ra) [Prolog:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 >D<E {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 urinarum differencia negocium multi ueterum medicorum aggressi sunt scribere.}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  ... - \u8230 \'85 sic incipe doctrinam secundum genera et secundum species et differencias earum.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;
\par \pard\fi0\li0\qj\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 (6ra-9va) [Text:] >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De diffinicione urine<. >U<{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Rina ergo est colamentum sanguinis, hanc autem alii superfluitatem}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 - \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (9va) ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et species et differencias conuenienter exposuimus.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Darunter, durch rote Durchstreichung hervorgehoben:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Expliciunt urine Teophili.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  Rest von 9va sowie 9vb leer.
