\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f2\b\lang1033\fs22 VS oben Rezeptnotiz \plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 (Nachtrag, 1. Viertel 14. Jh): \plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 Pulvis. Recipe viole, florum boraginis, seminum melonis, cucurbite, cucumeri a natura dragmam unam ... zuchere quod sufficit ad dulcorandum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .}

