\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 37ra-47vb}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6922/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Medizinischer Traktat und Notizen \u252 \'fcber Unfruchtbarkeit, Schwangerschaft, Geburt, Menstruation usw.}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  (nach {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Avicenna}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 , \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[1].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Canon medicinae}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 \lquote , Buch III, Fen 21): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Secundum quod Auicenna serenissimus medicorum princeps in tertio Canonis}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  fen 21 capitulo octavo \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Fen 21, Traktat I, Cap. 8-10:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 dicit de regimine et cura sterilitatis, regimen sterilitatis diuiditur in duos modos, quorum vnus est ad insignacionem et subtilitatem in ea, secundus est ad curacionem causarum prohibentium inpregnacionem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (39va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et debemus respicere\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 tempus et dietas mulierum, antequam curam incipiamus. \endash  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ab 39va zahlreiche abschnittsweise erg\u228 \'e4nzte, sich meist thematisch anschlie\u223 \'dfende\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  Notizen\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (Signa, Rezepte, Experimenta), zumeist wohl \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 Exzerpte aus Avicenna: ,Canon medicinae\lquote , Buch III, Fen 21\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 , z.B.: (39va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Signa inpregnacionis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (40va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Signa propinquantis partus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (40vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Signa fetus debilis\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (41ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota de apetitu corrupto inpregnantis mulieris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (41rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota, quod suppositoria, quibus vtimur possunt esse 9\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (41va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota secundum Auicennam, si contingat abosus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (= abortus) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 propter lubricitatem matricis et liquiditatem\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (42ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota secundum Auicennam, quod fetus aborsus prouocatur\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (42rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 De medicinis singularibus, que non sunt multum calide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Experimentum conseruans iuuentutem est bibere continue lac ieiuno stomacho\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota secundum Auicennam instrumentum, quomodo fiat iniectio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 in matricem \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Tract. II, Cap. 13]; (42va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota circa capitulum de mola \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Tract. II, Cap. 18]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 : Nota mulier habens molam in ventre\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  accidunt signa similia multa inpregnante, scilicet retentio menstrue et casvs appetitus; et mutatio coloris\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota quod quandoque mola remanet quatuor annis vel quinque, quandoque remanet ad finem vite\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (43ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Notandum, quod mensis medicinalis continet 26 dies et 22 horas. Tres septimane medicinales essent 20 dies et 4 hore ...\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (43rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Balneum mollificatiuum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (43va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Hic determinat de regimine difficultatis partus, dum os matricis incipit aperiri; \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (43vb) Quaestio:\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  Vtrum materia peccans in subtilitate debeat ingrossare per medicum. Primo probatur quod sic\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  primo auctoritate Galieni in quarto De interioribus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (44ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 arguo contra conclusionem primam\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ...; (44va) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Egritudines contingentes post partum\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ;\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (44vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Emplastrum restringens fluxum in partu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (45ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Docet remederi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 retentionem menstrvorum, dicit, quod si mulier, que de nono peperit, non habeat menstrva\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (45rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Nota operationes medicine calide ... Nota operationes medicine frigide\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (45vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Dicit Auicenna, quod menstrva proueniunt dupliciter\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ; (47vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Auicenna docet hic\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  [Tract. III, Cap. 9] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 curare vlcera matricis per ... et oportet considerare, si sunt sordidum \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (!)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  vel non ... vsque ad mediocrem inspissationem ista incoctio \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  est multum mundificativam et tertii et constrictivam \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?)\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  aliquantulum etc.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Im Amplonius-Katalog als \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Scriptum optimum de causa sterilitatis \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ({\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CA 2\u176 \'b0 404, 25r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 )\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Von Schum und Pfeil der gesamte Passus 37ra-47vb so angesetzt.\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  }

