\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 135v darunter \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (Nachtrag, zeitnah)\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  Krankheitslunar, Exzerpt aus Galenus: \u8218 \'82De dinamidiis\rquote , Buch 2: Cap. \u8218 \'82De diebus timendis\rquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Si quis in prima die mensis cuiusque in infirmitatem inciderit, sequens dies tercius est\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 timendus, quem si transierit infirmus usque ad XX dies euadet.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Qui uero secundo die deciderit,\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 XIIIIus timendus, quem si euadet\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 transierit diu euadet licet egrotans\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Qui XXX usque XXXI die deciderit dubium est, vtrum viuat vel moriatur.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Zum Text: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://www.galenolatino.com/traduzioni.php?id=10"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\ul\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat18\cf17 https://www.galenolatino.com/traduzioni.php?id=10}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . \endash  Verglichen mit dem Druck in Pars Secunda Opera Galieni, Venedig 1502 (USTC 831373= EDIT 16 CNCE 20136)\plain \f2\lang1033\fs22 .}

