\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 Inhalt: 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa0\itap0 \plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 71ra-78rb}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Jacobus de Duaco}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones et sententia super librum De longitudine et brevitate vitae Aristotelis'}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\u252 \'fcber dem Schriftraum von NH1:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Glosa et questiones super tractatum de longitudine et breuitate vite
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 S}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 icut vvlt Philosophus in ultimo capitulo primi libri De partibus animalium}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , substanciarum quecumque natura constant, hee quidem permanent, eedem numero toto eterno, hee autem sunt generales et corruptibiles \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (71rb) [Quaestio 1:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Antequam ad litteram accedamus queramus quedam extra litteram et queram primo, utrum De longitudine et brevitate vite possit esse \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 sciencia, et videtur quod non \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (78rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 quia ibi est nutritio, que est ad conservandum idem numero\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 ideo non valet.
\par \pard\sl254\slmult1\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Lohr, Medieval Latin Aristotle commentaries 3 (1970), S. 140 f., Nr. 8 (sechs Hss., ohne diese, mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 CA 4\u176 \'b0 188, Bl. 81v-86r}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 ). \endash  Verzeichnet bei: Markowski, Repertorium commentariorum medii aevi in Aristotelem Latinorum quae in Bibliotheca Amploniana Erffordiae asservantur (1987), S. 97, 175. \endash  Weijers, Le travail intellectuel \u224 \'e0 la Facult\u233 \'e9 des arts de Paris 4 (2001), S. 102 (7 Hss., ohne diese). \endash  https://sip.mirabileweb.it/title/quaestiones-et-sententia-super-librum-de-longitudi-title/15216 (sieben Hss., ohne diese). - Lohr/Colomba, Latin Aristotle Commentaries I.1 (2013), S. 225 f. (acht Hss., mit dieser).}

