\pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 92va-109vb}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (= Schum: 92va-101vb [!])\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Thomas de Aquino}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 : \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Quaestiones disputatae de anima}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs22 \lquote 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [\u220 \'dcber dem Schriftraum, sorgf\u228 \'e4ltige Kursive, 3. Viertel 14. Jh., [nicht NH1]:] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Incipiunt questiones fratris Thome super librum De anima.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 Q}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 uestio est de anima et primo queritur}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Quaestio 1:], \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vtrum anima humana sit forma et hoc aliquid. Et videtur, quod non. Si enim anima est hoc aliquid est subsistens \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (109ra) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 U\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 icesimoprimo queritur \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [Quaestio 21:]\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 , vtrum anima separata posset pati penam ab igne corporeo. Et uidetur quod non\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (109vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 que autem intelligili\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  (!, gemeint: intelligi?) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 possunt corporaliter. Et hec de anima dicta sufficiant. Explicit opus fratris Thome. 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 Verzeichnet bei: Dondaine/Shooner, Codices manuscripti operum Thomae de Aquino 1 (1967), Nr. 731 (S. 271). \endash  Text online verf\u252 \'fcgbar unter: https://www.corpusthomisticum.org/qda00.html, nach dem Text der Edition von Calcaterra/Centi, Turin-Rom 1953. \endash  Au\u223 \'dferdem: Baz\u225 \'e1n, Quaestiones disputatae de anima\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (Thomae de Aquino Opera omnia iussu Leonis XIII, Bd. 24/1\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (1996). \u220 \'dcbersetzung ins Deutsche: Sch\u246 \'f6nberger: Thomas von Aquin: Quaestiones disputatae de anima (2024)\plain \f2\lang1033\fs24 .}

