\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://4665/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 63ra-72ra}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24  {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[0].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Averro\u235 \'ebs}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 : \u8218 \'82{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezwrk[0].6930/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 De theriaca}}\plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24 \lquote  in der \u220 \'dcbersetzung des {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://bezper[1].4100/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\b\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 Armengaudus Blasii}}
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 >I<nquit magnus medicus Hamet Aueroys}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 : Postquam prius deo gracias egero, dicam, quod quidam ex amicis meis, cuius honore teneor, me rogauit, ut eius dictis satisfacerem uia experimenti et rationis de ista medicina, de qua locuti sunt medici in loco sui, que dicta est tyriaca\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \u8230 \'85 \endash  \u8230 \'85 (72ra) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 Et nunc autem quiescat postulacio et sufficiat satisfaccio secundum tempus\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 .\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24  Laus sit deo, qui me comprehendendi\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs24 posse largitus est. Explicit liber, quem composuit Hamet Aueroys de uirtutibus et operacionibus tyriace. Deo gracias.
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 eTK 0750B (sechs Hss., ohne diese, aber mit {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5007[0].501m/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs24\chcbpat17 2\u176 \'b0 249 und 2\u176 \'b0 270}}\plain \f1\lang1033\fs24 ). \endash  Hsl. \u220 \'dcberlieferung: DARE-Datenbank (https://dare.uni-koeln.de/app/works?&work_id=207): 25 Hss. (mit dieser). \endash  Druck in: Magninus Mediolanensis, Regimen sanitatis, Lyon um 1502 (GW M19896; Klebs 640.5), Bl. 98v-104v.}

