\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 105va-106vb Prolog und Verzeichnis der Simplicia nach Qualit\u228 \'e4ten und Graden: {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 F}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[0].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 ert actor}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [!, so auch in Leipzig, UB, MS 1114; sonst: Pertracto] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 aliqualiter de sciencia conseruativa sanitatis in primo libro opusculi mei, quod \u8222 \'84Michi competit\ldblquote  nominaui, tractandum esset more multorum de sciencia egritudinis curatiua\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (106vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Papauer de quo fit opium et ipsum opium frigidum et siccum in quarto gradu\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 . 
\par \pard\fi0\li0\ql\ri0\sb0\sa120\itap0 106vb-203rb Text (Simplicia von Absinthium bis Zuccarum, s. Inhaltsverzeichnis 93ra-v): {\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 >}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 A}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 <}}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "hida://5650[1].5666l/?u"}{\fldrslt \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22\chcbpat17 bsinteon est herba nota}}\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  et communis vsui medicine conueniens\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  sed non cibo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (200va) >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Z\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 vccarum est calida et humida in primo\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (200vb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 hec de zuccaro sufficiant.\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  >\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Q\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 <\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 uia mencio\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 pluries in isto libro fit de virtute prima, secunda et tercia medicine\plain \f2\i\lang1033\fs22 ,\plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22  congruum esset exprimere vnde medicinis insunt virtutes predicte et quibus qualibet operantur et quare in tali ordine\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22  ... \endash  ... (203rb) \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 et propter hoc aput multos numeratur inter sapores et est secundum eos octauus sapor. Hec ad presens de sapore sufficiant etc\plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 .< [Darunter von zwei anderen H\u228 \'e4nden zwei Explicits nachgetragen, das zweite wohl als Korrektur des ersten gemeint:] [1.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit de uirtutibus scilicet prima, secunda et sic de aliis. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 [2.] \plain \f1\i\lang1033\fs22 Explicit de uirtutibus scilicet prima, secunda et tercia etc. \plain \f1\lang1033\fs22 (beide H\u228 \'e4nde Bastarda, 2. Drittel 15. Jh.)
